<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Mem-<math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>: Learning Memory Construction via Reinforcement Learning</h1>
