<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Performance and memory consumption on MemoryAgentBench. <span id="A3.T9.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Perf.</span>: task-specific metrics (F1/Accuracy), <span id="A3.T9.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mem.</span>: memory in thousands of tokens. AR: Accurate Retrieval, TTL: Time Time Learning, LRU: Long Range Understanding. Best performance values are shown in <span id="A3.T9.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>.</figcaption>
